   <conbody><p>Resetting the SMS mobile app removes any stored information such as network profiles, logs, and authentication references.</p>
         <p>To reset the SMS mobile app:</p>
    <ol>
    <li>Log in to the SMS mobile application.</li>
    <li>Tap Settings on the bottom menu.</li>
    <li><p>Scroll down and tap Reset App.</p>
      <fig>
                  <title>placeholder</title>
